WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.443 --> 00:00:10.477
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THE CULTURAL

00:00:10.511 --> 00:00:11.159
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THE CULTURAL

00:00:11.193 --> 00:00:12.898
REVOLUTION NOW IN PROGRESS IS

00:00:12.899 --> 00:00:14.098
MAKING A DANGEROUS TURN,

00:00:14.099 --> 00:00:15.634
ACTUALLY BEEN HERE FOR QUITE

00:00:15.636 --> 00:00:16.849
SOME TIME, WATCHING ELECTED

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.381
LEADERS SAY YOU ARE NOT ALLOWED

00:00:18.415 --> 00:00:19.897
TO PARTICIPATE IN THEIR SYSTEM

00:00:19.898 --> 00:00:22.604
IF YOU ARE THE WRONG COLOR.

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:24.647
DURING A RECENT ARGUMENT ON THE

00:00:24.648 --> 00:00:25.501
HOUSE FLOOR, DEMOCRATIC

00:00:25.536 --> 00:00:26.625
CONGRESSMAN OF LOUISIANA ARGUED

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:27.856
THAT SOME PEOPLE JUST SHOULDN’T

00:00:27.891 --> 00:00:29.572
BE IN THE DEBATE BECAUSE THEY

00:00:29.607 --> 00:00:31.680
ARE THE WRONG SKIN COLOR OR

00:00:31.681 --> 00:00:33.553
THEIR CHILDREN ARE.

00:00:33.554 --> 00:00:35.122
RICHMOND’S CLAIM STARTED OFF

00:00:35.123 --> 00:00:36.338
WITH A FIGHT WITH FLORIDA

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:37.171
CONGRESSMAN MATT GAETZ.

00:00:37.173 --> 00:00:38.254
&gt;&gt; YOU ALL ARE WHITE MALES.

00:00:38.289 --> 00:00:41.180
YOU NEVER LIVED IN MY SHOES AND

00:00:41.214 --> 00:00:43.250
YOU DO NOT KNOW WHAT IT’S LIKE

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:44.413
TO BE AN AFRICAN-AMERICAN MALE.

00:00:44.448 --> 00:00:45.350
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU SUGGESTING THAT

00:00:45.351 --> 00:00:48.149
YOU’RE CERTAIN THAT NONE OF US

00:00:48.184 --> 00:00:49.401
HAVE NONWHITE CHILDREN?

00:00:49.402 --> 00:00:51.157
BECAUSE HE REFLECTED ON YOUR

00:00:51.158 --> 00:00:52.677
BLACK SON, THAT NONE OF US COULD

00:00:52.679 --> 00:00:53.057
UNDERSTAND.

00:00:53.059 --> 00:00:54.578
&gt;&gt; I AM NOT ABOUT TO GET

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.422
SIDETRACKED ABOUT THE COLOR OF

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:58.357
OUR CHILDREN.

00:00:58.359 --> 00:01:00.460
I RECLAIM MY TIME.

00:01:00.495 --> 00:01:03.139
IS NOT ABOUT THE COLOR OF YOUR

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:03.587
KIDS.

00:01:03.588 --> 00:01:06.463
IT IS ABOUT BLACK MALES, BLACK

00:01:06.497 --> 00:01:08.245
PEOPLE IN THE STREETS THAT ARE

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:10.325
GETTING KILLED AND IF ONE OF

00:01:10.326 --> 00:01:12.817
THEM HAPPENS TO BE YOUR KID, I’M

00:01:12.852 --> 00:01:14.089
CONCERNED ABOUT HIM TOO AND

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:15.318
CLEARLY I’M MORE CONCERNED ABOUT

00:01:15.319 --> 00:01:17.963
HIM THEN YOU ARE.

00:01:17.964 --> 00:01:23.237
SO LET’S BE CLEAR ABOUT THAT.

00:01:23.239 --> 00:01:26.825
&gt;&gt; YOU THINK I’M THINK YOU ARE M

00:01:26.826 --> 00:01:29.015
CONCERNED ABOUT MY FAMILY.

00:01:29.016 --> 00:01:31.455
YOU SHOULD TAKE THOSE WORDS DOWN

00:01:31.456 --> 00:01:32.791
DOWN.

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:36.588
&gt;&gt; THE GENTLEMAN WILL SUSPEND.

00:01:36.589 --> 00:01:39.029
IT BELONGS TO THE GENTLEMAN FROM

00:01:39.031 --> 00:01:39.802
LOUISIANA.

00:01:39.804 --> 00:01:42.514
&gt;&gt; WAS THAT A NERVE?

00:01:42.516 --> 00:01:44.142
&gt;&gt; THE GENTLEMAN FROM LOUISIANA.

00:01:44.176 --> 00:01:45.349
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHEN YOU ATTACK

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:46.677
PEOPLE ON THE BASIS OF THEIR

00:01:46.711 --> 00:01:50.605
RACE AND THEIR CHILDREN, YOU GET

00:01:50.606 --> 00:01:51.791
EXCHANGES LIKE THAT.

00:01:51.793 --> 00:01:53.622
CEDRIC RICHMOND WILL NEVER BE

00:01:53.657 --> 00:01:54.637
DISCIPLINED FOR IT.

00:01:54.638 --> 00:01:55.724
AFTERWARD, MATT GAETZ ISSUED THE

00:01:55.758 --> 00:01:57.705
STATEMENT ON TWITTER.

00:01:57.707 --> 00:02:00.951
"FOR ALL THOSE WONDERING, MY SON

00:02:00.985 --> 00:02:03.406
CAME FROM CUBA LEGALLY AND LIVES

00:02:03.441 --> 00:02:07.257
WITH ME IN FLORIDA."

00:02:07.259 --> 00:02:10.210
THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR COMING ON.

00:02:10.212 --> 00:02:12.660
CEDRIC RICHMOND WHO WENT TO

00:02:12.694 --> 00:02:14.374
TULANE LAW SCHOOL AND BRAGS

00:02:14.376 --> 00:02:16.351
ABOUT HIS LAW DEGREE WAS TELLING

00:02:16.353 --> 00:02:18.157
YOU THAT YOU ARE NOT ALLOWED TO

00:02:18.191 --> 00:02:19.480
PARTICIPATE IN THE CONVERSATION

00:02:19.515 --> 00:02:21.166
BECAUSE OF YOUR SKIN COLOR?

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.729
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE EVERYONE SHOULD BE

00:02:22.764 --> 00:02:24.411
ABLE TO PARTICIPATE IF THEY ARE

00:02:24.413 --> 00:02:25.568
BLACK, WHITE, OR OTHERWISE AND

00:02:25.603 --> 00:02:27.340
IT IS CERTAINLY OFFENSIVE TO

00:02:27.341 --> 00:02:28.867
HAVE SOMEONE TELL YOU THAT YOU

00:02:28.901 --> 00:02:30.435
DON’T KNOW WHAT A CERTAIN

00:02:30.436 --> 00:02:32.043
EXPERIENCE IS LIKE WHEN THEY

00:02:32.078 --> 00:02:33.683
KNOW NOTHING ABOUT YOU.

00:02:33.685 --> 00:02:36.137
NESTOR IS THE LIGHT OF MY LIFE.

00:02:36.171 --> 00:02:37.640
I COULDN’T IMAGINE LOVING HIM

00:02:37.675 --> 00:02:38.941
ANYMORE IF HE WAS MY OWN FLESH

00:02:38.976 --> 00:02:39.724
AND BLOOD.

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:42.236
I’VE RAISED HIM FOR THE LAST SIX

00:02:42.237 --> 00:02:43.586
YEARS, AND HE IS THE MOST

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:44.907
REMARKABLE YOUNG MAN.

00:02:44.941 --> 00:02:47.650
I AM PROUD OF HIM, AND I AM

00:02:47.684 --> 00:02:48.729
HONESTLY EMBARRASSED OF THE

00:02:48.764 --> 00:02:50.164
UNITED STATES CONGRESS THAT WE

00:02:50.199 --> 00:02:51.129
HAVE RESORTED TO CRITICIZING

00:02:51.163 --> 00:02:53.349
EACH OTHER BASED ON OUR RACE AND

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:55.856
THE RACE OF OUR CHILDREN AND I

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:57.981
WISH THAT WE COULD BE MORE

00:02:58.016 --> 00:02:58.836
PRODUCTIVE GOING FORWARD.

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:00.354
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DID ANY REPUBLICANS

00:03:00.388 --> 00:03:01.981
ON YOUR SIDE OF THE AISLE STAND

00:03:01.982 --> 00:03:03.379
UP AND MAKE THAT POINT?

00:03:03.381 --> 00:03:05.229
IT SEEMS LIKE A PRETTY BASIC

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:07.158
THRESHOLD THAT WE ARE NOT GOING

00:03:07.159 --> 00:03:09.210
TO ATTACK PEOPLE FOR THINGS THEY

00:03:09.244 --> 00:03:09.839
CAN’T CONTROL.

00:03:09.873 --> 00:03:10.857
DID ANYONE ELSE JOINING YOUR

00:03:10.892 --> 00:03:11.468
DEFENSE?

00:03:11.502 --> 00:03:14.398
&gt;&gt; THERE WERE SOME REPUBLICANS

00:03:14.433 --> 00:03:16.327
WHO POINTED OUT THAT WE

00:03:16.361 --> 00:03:17.697
SHOULDN’T BE TREATING ANYBODY

00:03:17.699 --> 00:03:18.727
DIFFERENTLY AS A CONSEQUENCE OF

00:03:18.729 --> 00:03:19.448
THEIR RACE.

00:03:19.483 --> 00:03:21.195
JUST GOT TO SAY, HE HAS A

00:03:21.196 --> 00:03:21.913
REMARKABLE YOUNG MAN.

00:03:21.915 --> 00:03:24.843
I AM PROUD OF HIM, AND I HAVE

00:03:24.877 --> 00:03:26.701
RAISED HIM TO BELIEVE THAT IN

00:03:26.735 --> 00:03:28.224
OUR FAMILY, WE TREAT EVERYONE

00:03:28.225 --> 00:03:29.054
EQUALLY.

00:03:29.088 --> 00:03:30.539
DOESN’T MATTER WHAT THEIR

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:33.778
BACKGROUND IS, WE TREAT EVERY

00:03:33.779 --> 00:03:34.831
AMERICAN WITH RESPECT.

00:03:34.832 --> 00:03:37.097
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DOES HE LEARN THAT

00:03:37.099 --> 00:03:38.887
AT SCHOOL AS WELL?
AND USING THE CULTURE IN WHICH

00:03:38.888 --> 00:03:42.508
AND USING THE CULTURE IN WHICH

00:03:42.509 --> 00:03:49.750
HE IS GOING UP REINFORCES THAT?

00:03:49.751 --> 00:03:52.551
WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF

00:03:52.585 --> 00:03:55.045
CEDRIC RICHMOND’S ATTACKS?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:59.538
DID YOU SEE ALL OF THIS?

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:02.622
&gt;&gt; I DID NOT SEE IT BECAUSE I

00:04:02.623 --> 00:04:06.134
WAS SLEEPING FROM WORK THE NIGHT

00:04:06.136 --> 00:04:08.222
BEFORE, BUT ONCE I WOKE UP, I

00:04:08.224 --> 00:04:09.357
WOKE UP TO SEEING ALL THESE

00:04:09.358 --> 00:04:11.771
TWEETS AND I WAS LIKE WHAT IS

00:04:11.805 --> 00:04:12.565
GOING ON?

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.121
AND GIVE ME A CALL TELLING ME

00:04:14.122 --> 00:04:19.355
ABOUT IT AND THEN I SAW IT, AND

00:04:19.389 --> 00:04:22.338
I THINK IT’S UNFAIR TO TELL

00:04:22.339 --> 00:04:24.468
SOMEONE THAT THEY DON’T

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:27.213
UNDERSTAND BECAUSE THEY DON’T

00:04:27.247 --> 00:04:30.471
HAVE -- BECAUSE OF THEIR RACIAL

00:04:30.472 --> 00:04:30.695
COLOR.

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:32.933
WHILE HE IS FIGHTING FOR

00:04:32.968 --> 00:04:35.059
EQUALITY BUT IF YOU TELL SOMEONE

00:04:35.093 --> 00:04:36.383
DID NOT GET INVOLVED, DOESN’T

00:04:36.385 --> 00:04:38.341
UNDERSTAND BECAUSE OF THE COLOR,

00:04:38.375 --> 00:04:39.602
YOU ARE BEING A HYPOCRITE THERE.

00:04:39.603 --> 00:04:44.197
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I THINK THAT IS

00:04:44.231 --> 00:04:46.653
VERY NICELY PUT.

00:04:46.688 --> 00:04:48.683
CONGRESSMAN GAETZ, SAYING THIS

00:04:48.718 --> 00:04:51.445
OUT LOUD SEEMS LIKE THE KIND OF

00:04:51.479 --> 00:04:53.467
THINGS THAT IN NORMAL TIMES, YOU

00:04:53.468 --> 00:04:54.990
WOULD BE CENSURED FOR.

00:04:54.991 --> 00:04:56.314
&gt;&gt; I CANNOT BELIEVE THAT IT’S

00:04:56.315 --> 00:04:57.216
ACCEPTABLE IN THE UNITED STATES

00:04:57.217 --> 00:04:58.584
CONGRESS FOR SOMEONE TO TELL

00:04:58.585 --> 00:04:59.496
SOMEONE ELSE THAT THEY ARE

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:00.887
FIGHTING FOR THEIR CHILDREN MORE

00:05:00.921 --> 00:05:01.537
THAN THEY ARE.

00:05:01.571 --> 00:05:02.185
YOU HAVE A SON.

00:05:02.187 --> 00:05:04.289
HOW WOULD YOU FEEL IF SOMEONE

00:05:04.324 --> 00:05:06.044
SAID TO YOU THAT THEY WERE

00:05:06.079 --> 00:05:06.972
FIGHTING FOR YOUR OWN FAMILY

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:08.289
MORE THAN YOU WERE?

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:12.419
THAT’S WHY I GOT VERY UPSET, BUT

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:14.975
FOR THE SAKE OF NESTOR AND MY

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:16.494
STORY, WE ARE VERY PROUD FAMILY

00:05:16.528 --> 00:05:17.753
AND LOVE EACH OTHER VERY MUCH

00:05:17.788 --> 00:05:19.155
AND HE’S ON HIS WAY OFF TO

00:05:19.189 --> 00:05:20.813
COLLEGE IN THE FALL AND I

00:05:20.815 --> 00:05:21.977
COULDN’T BE HAPPIER AND PROUDER

00:05:21.978 --> 00:05:24.229
OF THE YOUNG MAN HE’S BECOME AND

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:25.704
THE FACT THAT HE IS EMBRACING

00:05:25.705 --> 00:05:26.476
THESE AMERICAN VALUES THAT

00:05:26.477 --> 00:05:28.228
EVERYONE SHOULD BE TREATED

00:05:28.263 --> 00:05:29.491
FAIRLY AND EQUALLY.

00:05:29.525 --> 00:05:30.539
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT’S EXACTLY

00:05:30.541 --> 00:05:31.030
RIGHT.

00:05:31.031 --> 00:05:33.160
I TELL MY KIDS ARE NOT

00:05:33.161 --> 00:05:34.033
RESPONSIBLE FOR WHO YOUR

00:05:34.035 --> 00:05:34.969
RELATIVES ARE, YOU ARE

00:05:34.971 --> 00:05:36.172
RESPONSIBLE FOR WHAT YOU DO WHEN

